activity Monitor Seismic Activity
activity Issue Early Warning
activity Activate Emergency Response
activity Deploy Rescue Teams
activity Provide Medical Assistance
activity Distribute Relief Supplies
activity Assess Disaster Risk
activity Evacuate Affected Population
activity Establish Temporary Shelters
activity Complete Damage Assessment
bind Monitor Seismic Activity: Seismic Magnitude
bind Issue Early Warning: Warning Level
bind Activate Emergency Response: Response Status
bind Deploy Rescue Teams: Number of Rescue Teams
bind Provide Medical Assistance: Number of Injured People
bind Distribute Relief Supplies: Number of Relief Units, Damage Estimate
bind Assess Disaster Risk: Risk Score
bind Evacuate Affected Population: Number of Evacuated People
bind Establish Temporary Shelters: Number of Shelters
bind Complete Damage Assessment: Damage Estimate
Seismic Magnitude: integer between 0 and 10
Warning Level: Low, Medium, High, Critical
Response Status: Initiated, Ongoing, Completed
Number of Rescue Teams: integer between 0 and 50
Number of Injured People: integer between 0 and 10000
Number of Relief Units: integer between 0 and 20000
Risk Score: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Number of Evacuated People: integer between 0 and 50000
Number of Shelters: integer between 0 and 20
Damage Estimate: float between 0.0 and 1000000000.0
Init[Monitor Seismic Activity] | |
Response[Monitor Seismic Activity, Issue Early Warning] | | |
Chain Response[Issue Early Warning, Activate Emergency Response] | | |
Response[Activate Emergency Response, Deploy Rescue Teams] | | |
Response[Deploy Rescue Teams, Provide Medical Assistance] | | |
Response[Provide Medical Assistance, Distribute Relief Supplies] | | |0,24,h
Response[Monitor Seismic Activity, Assess Disaster Risk] | | |
Response[Assess Disaster Risk, Evacuate Affected Population] |A.Risk Score > 70 | |
Response[Assess Disaster Risk, Establish Temporary Shelters] |A.Risk Score > 70 | |
Precedence[Distribute Relief Supplies, Complete Damage Assessment] | | |